  95:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @brief Universal Serial Interface Channel(USIC) driver for serial communication.
  96:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  *
  97:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The Universal Serial Interface Channel(USIC) module is a flexible interface module
  98:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * covering several serial communication protocols. A USIC module contains two
  99:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * independent communication channels named USICx_CH0 and USICx_CH1, with x
 100:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * being the number of the USIC module. The user can program, during run-time, which protocol will 
 101:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * by each communication channel and which pins are used.
 102:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The driver provides APIs, configuration structures and enumerations to configure common features
 103:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * communication protocols.
 104:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 
 105:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * USIC driver features:
 106:C:/Workspaces/DAVE-4.3/WS_2016_09_02/XMC1300Stepper9201_V3.2/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * -# Allows configuration of FIFO for transmit and receive functions.
